  "steps": [
    "Boil the soya chunks: boil soya chunks for 5–6 minutes, squeeze out excess water and set aside.",
    "Prepare the marinade: mix Greek yoghurt, besan, ginger garlic paste and all the spices to form a thick marinade.",
    "Marinate: add soya chunks, bell peppers and onions to the marinade and coat well.",
    "Air fry: air fry the marinated soya chunks with a spray of oil at 180°C for 10–15 minutes until golden brown.",
    "Prepare the dressing: mix Greek yoghurt and green chutney until smooth.",
    "Assemble: add the air-fried soy chunks to a bowl, pour the dressing and toss well.",
    "Serve: serve fresh as a high-protein, fiber-rich salad."
